## Model card

- **Claimed name:** Codestral (folder slug `codestral`, id `opencode/codestral`).
- **Finding:** Mistral AI's open-weight 22B code model for low-latency code completion, inline fill-in-the-middle (FIM), and developer tool assistance (released May 29, 2024; MNPL license). Mistral's announcement publishes benchmark charts (HumanEval, MBPP, Spider, RepoBench, multi-language HumanEval, FIM) but the figures are embedded in images not extractable as verified text; the Hugging Face model card lists no numeric benchmark values. No Artificial Analysis / Epoch AI / Vals AI / BenchLM / SWE-bench / Terminal-Bench row exists for this exact ID.
- **Context window / modalities / pricing:** 32,768 native (extended to 128K on later checkpoints); text and code in/out; $0.30 / $0.90 per 1M ($0.03 cached input; Mistral AI).

### Raw benchmarks found

- No verified public benchmark score found for Codestral in accessible text: Mistral announcement benchmark figures are image-embedded and not extractable as verified numbers; Hugging Face model card lists no numeric values; no Artificial Analysis / Epoch AI / Vals AI / BenchLM / SWE-bench / Terminal-Bench row for this exact ID.

